# 0003: inline steer composer for child/subagent sessions.
# Files: packages/tui/src/routes/session/index.tsx    (render the host Prompt for child sessions)
#        packages/tui/src/context/local.tsx           (composer agent type follows the viewed child's agent)
#        packages/tui/src/app.tsx                      (do not carry a subagent agent into a new session)
#        packages/tui/src/component/prompt/index.tsx   (blue composer palette while viewing a subagent)
#        packages/tui/test/child-composer-steer.test.tsx (regression test)
# Viewing a child session renders the normal Prompt; typing submits to the viewed
# child as a steer (delivery defaults to "steer"). The composer's agent type
# reflects that child's own agent (often mode:"subagent", which the primary list
# excludes) and the whole composer box uses a distinct blue palette, so it is
# obvious who is being spoken to. The subagent picker stays opt-in via
# "session.child.first"; main-session behavior is unchanged. Applies on top of
# 0001 + 0002 on opencode v2.0.23 (0fd7e2829449b052abf0078666669302923d77af).
